{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfhowC2AQoNoyr29jm31E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written the candidate `bayesian_chance_vs_repeating_motif`, and it passes the self-check (`OK`). The check doesn't test novelty or convergence, and the smoke fit raised two warnings, covered below.\n\n**Which model I refined and what changed:** it builds on the incumbent `bayesian_overalternating_chance_model`. The incumbent compares a fair coin, which people believe switches sides more than half the time, against two \"regular\" generators: a coin with an unknown tendency to switch or repeat, and a coin with an unknown heads bias. The one change is a third regular generator, a \"repeating-pattern\" generator. It picks a short motif of 1–4 flips and repeats it, needing at least two full repeats. It gets a fitted share of the prior on regularity, so exactly periodic sequences count as patterns and look less random. Examples are HTHT…, HHTHHT… and HHTTHHTT….\n\n**Why:** this targets two discrepancies in the critique that survive the false-discovery correction:\n- The incumbent predicts people choose a perfectly alternating sequence 0.857 of the time; they actually do 0.768.\n- The incumbent doesn't penalise period-3/4 motifs enough: people choose them 0.46 of the time, against a predicted 0.509.\n\n**Check result:** the smoke fit used 1 chain with 100 draws and gave an ELPD-LOO of −1013.7, against the incumbent's −1021.6. That fit is too short to show my model is better. It raised two warnings:\n- **R-hat:** it can't be computed from a single chain, so convergence wasn't verified.\n- **Unreliable PSIS-LOO:** 9.2% of trials had Pareto k above 0.5, against a 1% tolerance, so the ELPD estimate itself is shaky. The very short fit may be the cause, but I didn't check. If it persists in admission's full fit, the score won't be trusted.\n\nFiles are in `.../experiment1/model_loop/iter_2/candidate_3/`:\n- `hypothesis.md`\n- `model_name.txt`\n- `candidate.py`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3383,"cache_read_input_tokens":60805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3383,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c252f7f2-8998-4b05-b2b1-cc586325b87b","uuid":"f31661ba-b456-4629-8e1e-bd7d196dbdd7","timestamp":"2026-10-04T20:14:49.398Z","request_id":"req_011CfhowBdMKtiYsyCoQE4YM"}
